  "limitations": [
    "The illuminance was the sole physical factor for visual comfort used in this study, limiting the generalizability of visual comfort findings. Other visual factors like color temperature, wall color, and window views were not included.",
    "The experimental design, with time-varying acoustic stimuli under steady-state thermal and illumination conditions, might have allowed participants to focus more on acoustic variations, potentially biasing results.",
    "Gender differences in comfort perception were observed, but these cannot be generalized without considering specific environmental conditions, suggesting a need for further research on individual differences."
  ],
